   369	def days_to_opening(readings):
   370	    """Per draw and covered matter: days from the matter's earliest listed article to the first covering question's opening. A question
   371	    opened before the scored window (09-07) is 'opened in the warm-up'; one opened in the window before the matter's first listed article
